ed from the web dashboard at zekehub.com. Built and maintained by the ZekeHub team since 2024.\n\nHOW TO USE\n1. Buy a key at https://zekehub.com/pricing?game=adoptme (priced by how many accounts you run at once)\n2. Paste your key between the quotes in getgenv().scriptkey=\"\"\n3. Run the script on each account and manage them all from your dashboard\n\nFARMING\n- Pet Farm and Baby Farm, with egg farming and a max pet count\n- Farm Until Full Grown, Prioritize Friendship and Selective Pet Farming\n- Task Exclusion to skip tasks you don't want done\n- Pet Pen levels pets and eggs while you farm\n- Event farming: Auto Admin Abuse and the Halloween 2026 event\n\nPETS\n- Auto Age Potion on selected pets\n- Auto Neon and Mega Neon\n- Auto Recycle for rewards\n\nTRADING\n- Auto Trading to listed usernames, by category or specific items\n- Auto Accept incoming trades and Auto Leave when done\n- Rarity blacklist plus global and per-pet filters\n- Gets the trade license automatically\n\nITEMS\n- Auto Buy, Auto Open gifts and Auto Pay players\n\nACCOUNTS AND PERFORMANCE\n- Web dashboard with live stats and config sync for every account\n- Account Manager swaps or kicks accounts when triggers are met\n- Discord webhooks for stats and pet unlocks\n- Stats overlay, reduced graphics and FPS cap to run more accounts per PC\n\nDATA NOTICE\nThe farm sends each account's Roblox username, inventory and farm stats to your ZekeHub dashboard so you can manage your accounts. Keys are bought and managed on zekehub.com.","tags":["mass farm","auto farm","pet farm","auto trade","dashboard"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/zekehub","keyLink":"https://zekehub.com/pricing?game=adoptme","owner":{"_id":"66f2e862881b161b87793a78","username":"zekehub","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ad5f86961f95d8654d9dff1f75654e119949c9f0bd99686848077bbde24f7d3e.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/66f2e862881b161b87793a78-1759260004507.png"},"lvl":7,"status":"offlin